    "zh": "模型、传输保真度、Pygame 主循环与渲染器构成被仿真的世界（传输层负责把理想链路变成有延迟/丢包/执行器滞后的现实链路）；HTTP 桥、无人机适配器与高度驱动器是让 Web 视图和控制器驱动它的接缝。",
    "en": "Models, the transport fidelity layer, the Pygame loop and the renderer make up the simulated world - the transport layer turns an ideal link into a realistic one with delay, loss and actuator lag; the HTTP bridge, drone adapter and altitude driver are the seams that let the web view and the controller drive it."
